AR NSPanel Pro — Licensing
==========================

This is a fork of the "DomoDreams Panel" Home Assistant integration
(https://github.com/domodreams/home-assistant-nspanel-pro), rebranded and
maintained independently. It carries forward ONLY the MIT-licensed Home
Assistant integration from that project.

It does NOT include, and is not a substitute for, the proprietary "DomoDreams
NSPanel Pro" Android app or DomoDreams' brand assets/screenshots — those
remain the exclusive property of their original author under their own
license and are unaffected by anything below. If you need a panel app, build
your own (see README) or use DomoDreams' official app under its own terms.

